---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const GROUP_URL = "https://www.facebook.com/share/g/14jtya1TGU2/";
---
<Base
  title="About and contact"
  description="About the Pelvic Organ Prolapse Support Society and how to reach us."
  current="/about/"
>
  <div class="narrow">
    <span class="label">About us</span>
    <h1>Why this site exists</h1>
    <p>
      This website is a project of the Pelvic Organ Prolapse Support Society, an
      online community working to break the silence around pelvic organ
      prolapse. No woman should have to discover this condition alone at two in
      the morning with only a search bar for company.
    </p>
    <p>Our aims are simple.</p>
    <ul class="spaced">
      <li>Explain prolapse in plain language</li>
      <li>Present every option honestly, including the parts that usually get glossed over</li>
      <li>Connect women with a community that understands</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        The best way to reach us is inside the community itself. Post your
        question in our
        <a href={GROUP_URL} rel="noopener">Facebook group</a> and an admin or
        one of the members will get back to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please note that we cannot give medical advice, in the group or
        anywhere else. For anything to do with your health, contact your
        healthcare provider.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>About this information</h2>
    <p>
      Content on this site draws on reputable medical sources, including the
      Cleveland Clinic, peer reviewed urogynecology journals, Cochrane reviews,
      and patient advocacy organizations. Our community admins review it for
      tone and accuracy, and we update it as the evidence changes. It is
      educational only, and it is never a substitute for care from your own
      provider.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
